DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_F22E_47CB';
<p>f22e_47cb</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene A</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #a32d36;"><i>artsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene A</span> has wings that are colorful and distinctive patterns.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006e59;">Gene D</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #006e59;"><i>dewy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006e59;">Gene D</span> appears moist, with its body covered in tiny droplets of water.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene J</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>jerky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene J</span> moves in rapid and sudden movements, displaying an unpredictable flight pattern.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, dewy, jerky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">644</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,288</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, jerky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">28,091</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">77,144</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, jerky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">77,201</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">27,598</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">jerky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,387</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">647</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">220,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>A</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>A</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_F22E_47CB
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(4,288 + 4,387 + 27,598 + 28,091)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>64,364</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.2926 = <strong>29.26 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(644 + 647 + 4,288 + 27,598)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>33,177</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.1508 = <strong>15.08 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(644 + 647 + 4,288 + 4,387)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>9,966</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.0453 = <strong>4.53 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(647 + 4,288 + 4,387 + 77,201)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>86,523</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.3933 = <strong>39.33 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(647 + 4,387 + 28,091 + 77,201)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>110,326</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.5015 = <strong>50.15 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(77,144 + 77,201)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>154,345</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.7016 = <strong>70.16 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(644 + 647 + 4,288 + 4,387)</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = <sup>9,966</sup>/<sub>220,000</sub> = 0.0453 = <strong>4.53 cM</strong>
LITERAL_F22E_47CB_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
